Package: gvmodel
Type: Package
Title: Generation-Verification Model for Remote Associates Responses
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Estimates individual spreading breadth (generation) and verification ability from
    remote associates test responses, using a hierarchical Bayesian model fitted in Stan. Builds
    per-cue spreading activation on a word-association network, constructs candidate sets, and
    returns person-level posterior summaries and screening statistics for careless responding.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: Matrix, methods, cmdstanr, posterior, loo, stats, utils
Suggests: knitr, data.table
URL: https://github.com/gxnuyuanbo-hash/gvmodel
BugReports: https://github.com/gxnuyuanbo-hash/gvmodel/issues
